# xcquinox.alec.cluster -- rsync filter rules for the "full" pull profile.
#
# Pulls the full run dir minus chatty SLURM /logs/. Use when you need the
# trained model.eqx checkpoints locally (e.g. for paper-figure re-evaluation
# or to re-run analysis that requires loading the actual networks).
#
# Loaded via `rsync --filter='. <abs path>/full.filter'`. Rules apply with the
# run dir (`run_<UTC>Z/`) as the transfer root.

# --- exclude the SLURM log tree -------------------------------------------
# `.out`/`.err` files are bulky (often several MB each, one per array task)
# and rarely needed off-cluster; pull them on demand with a separate
# `rsync seawulf:.../run_<UTC>Z/logs/ ./logs/` if you need a specific one.
- /logs/

# --- include everything else ----------------------------------------------
# The `***` matches the dir itself and every path below it.
+ /***
